window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Fiddler's Cove, Connecticut. Home to elegant artisan shops, boat tours, foggy mornings with hot cocoa, beautiful views of Long Island Sound . . . Also, witches and murderous mayhem.</p> <p>Middle aged sea witch Ruby Diamond returns for another magical mystery adventure. While looking for the missing father of her teenaged apprentice Allegra, Ruby and Chief of Police Jon \"Merman\" Miller stumble across a dead body.</p> <p>You'd think people would learn not to leave those things lying around!</p> <p>As always, Ruby is aided by the perpetually snarky and habitually mouthy feline familiar Rumpus as she searches for clues to unravel the mystery.</p> <p>This time, she'll need all the help she can get, because forces both mundane and magical are mustering to take her down before she can uncover the truth.</p> <p>Join Ruby, Jon, Rumpus, and the colorful denizens of Fiddler's Cove in the zany escapist cozy mystery series like no other.</p> <p>Will Ruby solve the mystery and bring the killer to justice? Or will the killer get her first, making this the last book in the series?</p>"; 
